---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service — Metadata Remover | User Rights & Conditions';
const description = 'Terms of Service for Metadata Remover. Free in-browser metadata removal tool. Learn about permitted use, zero-claim intellectual property, and disclaimers.';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://remover-metadados.com/en/terms/';
const alternatePt = 'https://remover-metadados.com/termos/';
const alternateEn = 'https://remover-metadados.com/en/terms/';
const contactEmail = 'hello@remover-metadados.com';
const lastUpdated = 'September 14, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  lang="en"
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
  alternatePt={alternatePt}
  alternateEn={alternateEn}
>
  <Header lang="en" ptUrl="/termos/" enUrl="/en/terms/" isSubpage={true} />

  <main class="page-wrap legal-page">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Back -->
    <nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb navigation">
      <a href="/en/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Metadata Remover</a>
      <span class="breadcrumb-separator">/</span>
      <span class="breadcrumb-current">Terms of Service</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header Block -->
    <header class="legal-header">
      <div class="legal-badge-row">
        <span class="badge-accent">TERMS OF USE</span>
        <span class="badge-mono">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-subtitle">
        By accessing and using <strong>Metadata Remover</strong> (remover-metadados.com), you acknowledge and agree to the terms and provisions stated below.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Highlight Box -->
    <section class="highlight-card">
      <div class="highlight-icon" aria-hidden="true">📜</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="highlight-title">Your Files Remain 100% Yours</h2>
        <p class="highlight-desc">
          <strong>Metadata Remover</strong> operates entirely on your local machine. <strong>We never claim any ownership, license, or copyright over any images, photos, PDFs, or documents you process.</strong> Because file contents are not uploaded for processing, you retain uninterrupted, absolute intellectual property rights over all your assets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Article Content -->
    <article class="legal-content">
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Scope of Service</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Metadata Remover</strong> is a free, browser-based utility that removes embedded metadata (including EXIF tags, GPS geolocations, camera serial numbers, standard author properties and some embedded provenance data, subject to format-specific limitations) from supported file formats (JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX).
        </p>
        <p>
          All operations execute locally via JavaScript and WebAssembly on your own device's computing hardware.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Permitted Use & User Obligations</h2>
        <p>
          By utilizing this utility, you agree that:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>You hold the legal right, ownership, or authorized license to sanitize and export the files processed through the application.</li>
          <li>You will not use this service to intentionally destroy evidence in pending or anticipated legal proceedings, facilitate unlawful fraud, or violate third-party rights.</li>
          <li>You bear sole responsibility for maintaining uncorrupted original backups of your files before conducting metadata removal operations.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Free Service with No Account Requirement</h2>
        <p>
          Access is provided <strong>100% free of charge</strong> without mandatory user registration, subscriptions, or credit card inputs. We reserve the right to improve, modify, or adjust client-side processing algorithms at any time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Disclaimer of Warranties ("As Is")</h2>
        <p>
          This service is provided strictly on an <em>"as is"</em> and <em>"as available"</em> basis without warranties of any kind, whether express, implied, or statutory:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>While we continuously refine our parsing algorithms against industry standards, proprietary camera maker notes, obscure document streams, or deeply nested metadata structures may occasionally remain unaffected.</li>
          <li>We do not warrant uninterrupted or error-free performance across outdated, unsupported, or non-standards-compliant web browsers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Under no circumstances shall <strong>Metadata Remover</strong>, its founder Dev Sharma, or its contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages resulting from:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Loss, alteration, or corruption of local file copies in the absence of a verified user backup.</li>
          <li>Misapplication or reliance on sanitized outputs for regulatory, courtroom, or forensic purposes.</li>
          <li>Local device crashes, memory exhaustion, or network disconnects during asset rendering.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Third-Party Links & Creator Profiles</h2>
        <p>
          This website references developer profiles on third-party networks (X / Twitter and LinkedIn). We do not oversee the policies or data handling practices of external services and advise reviewing their terms independently.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable internet legal standards and international consumer norms, respecting civil internet frameworks and data protection mandates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Inquiries & Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding these terms or wish to report technical issues:
        </p>
        <div class="contact-card-inline">
          <div class="contact-inline-item">
            <span class="contact-inline-label">Support Email:</span>
            <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="contact-email-link">{contactEmail}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-inline-item">
            <span class="contact-inline-label">Founder:</span>
            <span class="contact-inline-val">Dev Sharma</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>

    <!-- Bottom Actions -->
    <div class="legal-actions">
      <a href="/en/" class="btn-primary-action">
        <span>&larr; Return to Metadata Remover</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/privacy/" class="btn-secondary-action">
        <span>View Privacy Policy &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 946px; /* 860px * 1.1 */
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .breadcrumb-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .breadcrumb-separator,
  .breadcrumb-current {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .legal-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .badge-accent {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--btn-accent);
    color: var(--btn-accent-text);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .badge-mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .legal-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .highlight-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .highlight-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    background: var(--btn-accent);
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    border-radius: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .highlight-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .highlight-desc {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-section {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .legal-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.35rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .legal-section strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .contact-card-inline {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .contact-inline-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .contact-inline-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contact-email-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .contact-email-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .contact-inline-val {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .legal-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .btn-primary-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--btn-accent);
    color: var(--btn-accent-text);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: transform 0.12s ease, box-shadow 0.12s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary-action:hover {
    transform: translate(-1.5px, -1.5px);
    box-shadow: 4.5px 4.5px 0px var(--shadow-color);
  }

  .btn-secondary-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--shadow-color);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: transform 0.12s ease, box-shadow 0.12s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary-action:hover {
    background: var(--btn-accent);
    color: var(--btn-accent-text);
    transform: translate(-1.5px, -1.5px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .highlight-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }
    .legal-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .btn-primary-action,
    .btn-secondary-action {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
